WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,660 --> 00:00:02,660
There are no great men, which means

2
00:00:03,020 --> 00:00:04,620
There may be other survivors here

3
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:10,230
Who are the survivors? I don’t know Brother Lin.

4
00:00:10,590 --> 00:00:13,440
What should we do next since there are no great men?

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:14,920
Then of course we are looking for

6
00:00:14,920 --> 00:00:15,840
Way out of here

7
00:00:18,630 --> 00:00:20,270
From the School of Great Men to the Yellow Room

8
00:00:20,710 --> 00:00:23,590
It's safer this time. Let's go.

9
00:00:34,980 --> 00:00:35,940
How long have we not seen each other

10
00:00:35,940 --> 00:00:36,980
Normal sunlight

11
00:00:37,700 --> 00:00:39,660
I feel like my brain is going crazy

12
00:00:48,580 --> 00:00:49,580
This light is just right

13
00:00:50,100 --> 00:00:51,220
but it's not the sun

14
00:00:52,060 --> 00:00:54,340
Have you ever felt anything wrong?

15
00:00:54,740 --> 00:00:56,140
Can't sleep when I'm sleepy

16
00:00:56,420 --> 00:00:57,740
When I wake up, I want to sleep again

17
00:00:59,540 --> 00:01:01,140
I've been able to beat myself up even while standing these past two days.
